    "body": "Final quick gate on add3a87 (`scripts/gate.sh quick upstream/main`): the tools, sim and app suites are green, and ui has 309 lib tests passing. The failures:\n- The three headless-GPU tests (no adapter on this Mac). They fail the same way on main.\n- `tool_editor_snapshot`, on purpose: the editor gained a third column and the PNG golden is not regenerated here. With #359 merged, that test leaves the PR lane and is refreshed at the cut. If this lands before #359, the golden needs one `UPDATE_SNAPSHOTS=1` refresh on the merged tree.\n\nThe contributor's hands-on check passed. Ready.",
